{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──ほら、こんなの見つけた\r\nパス……！","trans":"——看，我找到这个了\n接着……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017290010","name":"霧子","text":"わ……！\r\n──よ、と……","trans":"哇……！\n——嘿、哟……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017290020","name":"霧子","text":"……ふふっ\r\nまつぼっくり……！","trans":"……呵呵\n是松果……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"お、気に入ったんならプレゼントだ","trans":"哦，喜欢的话就送你了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017290030","name":"霧子","text":"はい……","trans":"好的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-12","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──ああ、いや\r\nっていうのは冗談だけど────","trans":"——啊，不是\n刚才那句是开玩笑——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017290040","name":"霧子","text":"いえ……\r\nお迎え……しましょう……","trans":"不……\n还是……把它接回去吧……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901017290050","name":"霧子","text":"季節を……旅して……\r\nここまで来てくれたから……","trans":"它……穿越了季节……\n才来到这里的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}